[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705558200","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103713#issuecomment-2705558200","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103713","id":2705558200,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hQ4q4","user":{"login":"DeerLuuu","id":64859451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODU5NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64859451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu","html_url":"https://github.com/DeerLuuu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T05:23:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T05:27:22Z","body":"> 代码对我来说看起来不错。\r\n> \r\n> 我们可能希望将默认值增加到至少 50，如果这不会在低端设备（运行 Android 编辑器的智能手机/平板电脑）上导致性能问题，则可能增加到 100。\r\n\r\nI actually wrote a button in the quick load dialog that allows me to toggle whether history mode is enabled or not, but I haven't sent it out yet because I think they should be two commits\r\nThis is in response to the fact that developers still want to select files in history mode when the threshold for displaying all files is too high","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705558200/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706395878","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103713#issuecomment-2706395878","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103713","id":2706395878,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hUFLm","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T12:57:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T12:58:35Z","body":"I'm not sure why this limit even exists. There is already `max_results` setting, so if the dialog can support that many entries, it makes no sense to have another, smaller limit.\r\n\r\nbtw if the limit is exceeded, the dialog will show recently opened files instead, so it's not like it's empty.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706395878/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707291428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103713#issuecomment-2707291428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103713","id":2707291428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hXf0k","user":{"login":"DeerLuuu","id":64859451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODU5NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64859451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu","html_url":"https://github.com/DeerLuuu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T19:55:31Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T19:58:09Z","body":"> SHOW_ALL_FILES_THRESHOLD\r\n\r\nBut in the new project he was empty, because this resulted in a poor experience\r\n\r\nAs for the high threshold of SHOW_ALL_FILES_THRESHOLD, the history file mode will not be run. I also have pr implementation of this, and add a switch in the quick load dialog box to switch the history file mode when all displays are met\r\n\r\nI think the original SHOW_ALL_FILES_THRESHOLD is to prevent performance problems, but its default value is 30, which is too small, resulting in bad experience, the simplest way is to directly change the value to 50 or 100, but I took into account that each person's needs may be different. So an editor setting was added to change it\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707291428/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708870820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103713#issuecomment-2708870820","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103713","id":2708870820,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdhak","user":{"login":"stijn-h","id":25907608,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTA3NjA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25907608?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h","html_url":"https://github.com/stijn-h","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stijn-h/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T13:59:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T13:59:59Z","body":"The reason for the threshold wasn't really performance related. The idea was that if you have so few files that they can be displayed without scrolling, you might as well show them immediately. And if you have many files, if we do show a portion of them, it's unlikely that they are going to be relevant without typing some filter. But I don't think this was a good idea in hindsight.\r\n\r\nI wouldn't worry about a perfomance hit here. I would set the default value at like 100 or something, because the current default value of 30 is considered too low, and it would be better if people didn't need to edit this setting.\r\n\r\nUltimately I think the threshold can be removed completely, but then the logic for showing history has to be changed, either integrating it with the default candidates, or having a separate list you can toggle.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708870820/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708893460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103713#issuecomment-2708893460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103713","id":2708893460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hdm8U","user":{"login":"DeerLuuu","id":64859451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODU5NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64859451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu","html_url":"https://github.com/DeerLuuu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-09T14:44:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-09T14:44:32Z","body":"> 阈值的原因与性能无关。这个想法是，如果你的文件太少了，以至于它们无需滚动就可以显示，那么你还不如立即显示它们。如果你有很多文件，如果我们确实显示了其中的一部分，那么如果不输入一些过滤器，它们不太可能是相关的。但事后看来，我认为这不是一个好主意。\r\n> \r\n> 我不会担心这里的性能打击。我会将默认值设置为 100 左右，因为当前的默认值 30 被认为太低了，如果人们不需要编辑此设置会更好。\r\n> \r\n> 最终，我认为阈值可以完全删除，但是必须改变显示历史的逻辑，要么将其与默认候选者集成，要么有一个单独的列表，你可以切换。\r\n\r\nI implemented a separate pr is to add a switch in the quick load, you can open the display history file mode used\r\nI'll submit it later","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2708893460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718406500","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103713#issuecomment-2718406500","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103713","id":2718406500,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iB5dk","user":{"login":"DeerLuuu","id":64859451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0ODU5NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64859451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu","html_url":"https://github.com/DeerLuuu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeerLuuu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-12T16:11:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T16:16:08Z","body":"I will close this pr and submit a new pr\r\nthe new pr is about delete SHOW_ALL_FILES_THRESHOLD and the corresponding logic, and add a switch to enable and disable the history file mode in the fast loading.\r\n\r\n- #104037","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2718406500/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]